<title>FINLAND: NESTE UPS STAKE IN ASKO TO 26 PCT.</title>
<headline>NESTE UPS STAKE IN ASKO TO 26 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish oil and energy group Neste Oy on Thursday bought six percent of plastic pipe and furniture maker Asko Oy raising its ownership to 26 percent, a Neste spokeswoman said by telephone.</p>
<p>&quot;Neste has today bought six percent of Asko on the bourse. Our holding rose to 26 percent,&quot; she said, but declined to give the price of the deal.</p>
<p>On the bourse, a block of 423,000 Asko shares were traded at 250.00 markka per share.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
